      "value": "Agreed. I've always thought it was strange that the only way to show someone's avatar is to permanently show every avatar they're in forever until you disable it. Which is great for friends, but kinda weird for strangers.\n\nI'd love to be able to show someone's avatar and then have it hidden again when they change avatar or leave the instance, something along those lines. Anything that isn't permanent until manually toggled back off.",
